+applied 144-word abstract. It removes outdated abstract-application
+and unfinished-build/review descriptions, deferring live status to
+the workflow records. The abstract needs no proposed edit. The
+existing author-name-only signature and generic format are untouched.
+
+All four complete theorem environments, six numbered equation
+environments, other mathematical displays, inline mathematical
+tokens and labels are preserved byte-for-byte. All old citations
+remain; the sole added citation is the W26v5 background credit. This
+includes the user's and/quad/mbox typography. The mathematical setup
+and marked-domain reduction are unchanged. Old writer, standalone
+and retirement handoffs and all frozen records remain intact.
+
+Only section.tex, INTERFACE.md, this new handoff and the designated
+external FINAL-POLISH/s01_writer.md are edited. No shared abstract,
+bibliography, metadata, other section or state is changed by this
+author. No calculation or native compilation is performed.
